{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Golden Mystery Boxes are drop crates unlocked after claiming ",["l","精通山洞","Foraging Mastery"]," and viewing the cutscene with ",["l","齐先生","Mr. Qi"]," informing the player that ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es can now be found. They are similar to normal ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es, and they can be obtained in a variety of ways. With the exception of the ",["l","金色动物饼干","Golden Animal Cracker"]," and ",["l","自动抚摸机","Auto-Petter"],", every item in a Golden Mystery Box can also be found in a Mystery Box."]],["p",["Golden Mystery Boxes can be cracked by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g, similar to ",["l","矿物","Geode"],"s. However, unlike Geodes, they cannot be broken open using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]]]],["Locations",2,[["p",["The following table lists the different actions that can spawn a Golden Mystery Box."]],["p",["The \"Chance\" column below indicates the probabilities that the game will attempt to spawn a Golden Mystery Box. When such an attempt is made, the game performs a further check to see if it succeeds. If the player does not have ",["l","精通山洞","Foraging Mastery"],", the check will fail. Otherwise, the probability of succeeding is 66% if the player does not have the power obtained from the ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]," and 88% if they do."]],["p",["Also note that the chances of obtaining Golden Mystery Boxes from some of the sources depends on and increases with higher daily ",["l","运气","luck"],", and in some cases, with ",["l","运气","Luck Buffs"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Activity"]},{"h":1,"v":["Chance"]}],[["Regular ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"]],["9-17% (dependent on daily luck)"]],[[["l","钓鱼","Golden Fishing Treasure Chests"]],["12-21% (dependent on daily luck)"]],[[["l","淘盘","Panning"]],["5%"]],[["Shaking ",["l","树","trees"]," with seeds"],["3%"]],[[["l","怪物","Monsters"]],["0.01 + (Daily Luck / 10) + (Luck Buffs / 125)"]],[["Breaking containers in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]],["0.0081 + (Daily Luck / 15)"]],[["Chopping ",["l","树","trees"]," (Each Axe hit)"],["0.5%"]]]],["p",["In addition, Golden Mystery Boxes can be obtained by trading 3 ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Giant Stump"],". There is also a 3.6% chance to obtain 5 Golden Mystery Boxes from a ",["l","骷髅洞穴","treasure chest"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," if Foraging Mastery has been claimed. This chance is not subject to an additional check for success, but it is slightly increased if Farming Mastery and/or Combat Mastery have not been claimed."]]]],["Contents",2,[["p",["Below is a table of possible contents. All percent chances listed below are assuming that the player has claimed ",["l","精通山洞","Farming Mastery"]," (for the ",["l","金色动物饼干","Golden Animal Cracker"],") and has already received at least one ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"],". If Farming Mastery has not been claimed, then the chances for all other available items are slightly increased. If the player has not received their first ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"],", then the ",["l","星之书","Book Of Stars"]," cannot be obtained from Golden Mystery Boxes, and the Book of Mysteries has an increased chance. See the ",["l","谜之书","Book of Mysteries"]," page for more details."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["Chance"]}],[[["i","(O)GoldenAnimalCracker","Golden Animal Cracker ×1"]],["0.5%"]],[[["i","(BC)272","Auto-Petter ×1"]],["0.5%"]],[[["i","(O)279","Magic Rock Candy ×1"]],["0.4%"]],[[["i","(O)74","Prismatic Shard ×1"]],["0.79%"]],[[["i","(O)166","Treasure Chest ×1"]],["1.57%"]],[[["i","(O)PurpleBook","Book Of Stars ×1"]],["0.96%"]],[[["i","(O)Book_Mystery","Book of Mysteries ×1"]],["0.96%"]],[[["i","(O)797","Pearl ×1"]],["0.94%"]],[[["i","(O)373","Golden Pumpkin ×1"]],["0.94%"]],[[["i","(H)MysteryHat","Mystery Hat ×1"]],["1.85%"]],[[["i","(S)MysteryShirt","Mystery Shirt ×1"]],["1.81%"]],